 1                            II.   THIRD BENCH REQUEST
 2   Q.   What is the purpose of this supplemental testimony?

 3   A.   The purpose of my supplemental testimony is to respond to the following Third

 4        Bench Request issued by the New Mexico Public Regulation Commission

 5        (“Commission”):

 6                       “SPS shall provide updated and executable versions of the following
 7                       Rule 530 Schedules:”

 8                       •   “Schedule A-5: Summary of Total Capitalization and the
 9                           Weighted Average Cost of Capital”
10   Q.   Are you providing any updated attachments as part of your testimony?

11   A.   Yes. In response to the Third Bench Request from the Commission, I am providing

12        an updated version of Schedule A-5, which reflects the Stipulated equity ratio,

13        Return on Equity (“ROE”), and Weighted Average Cost of Capital (“WACC”).

14   Q.   Do you have any further comments on the updated schedule and attachments?

15   A.   Yes. Due to the Stipulated capital structure increasing the debt requirement, the

16        forecasted cost of debt increased by approximately four basis points in the Linkage

17        Period and three basis points in the Test Year. This increase in the cost of debt is

18        not fully captured in rates due to the settlement WACC of 7.59 percent.

19   Q.   Does this conclude your pre-filed supplemental testimony?

20   A.   Yes.

